{
  "id": "hercampus",
  "name": "hercampus",
  "risk": "low",
  "signupUrl": "https://www.hercampus.com/register/",
  "steps": [
    {
      "type": "goto",
      "url": "{{signupUrl}}"
    },
    {
      "type": "waitFor",
      "selector": "#user_email",
      "timeoutMs": 20000
    },
    {
      "type": "humanPause",
      "minMs": 600,
      "maxMs": 1600
    },
    {
      "type": "fill",
      "selector": "#user_firstname",
      "field": "firstName",
      "optional": true
    },
    {
      "type": "fill",
      "selector": "#user_lastname",
      "field": "lastName",
      "optional": true
    },
    {
      "type": "fill",
      "selector": "#user_email",
      "field": "email"
    },
    {
      "type": "fill",
      "selector": "#user_password",
      "field": "password"
    },
    {
      "type": "fill",
      "selector": "#confirm_user_password",
      "field": "password"
    },
    {
      "type": "fill",
      "selector": "#user_description",
      "field": "description",
      "optional": true
    },
    {
      "type": "fill",
      "selector": "#mce-EMAIL",
      "field": "email"
    },
    {
      "type": "click",
      "selector": "label[for='field_604eb9c540cee']",
      "optional": true
    },
    {
      "type": "captchaGate"
    },
    {
      "type": "humanPause",
      "minMs": 500,
      "maxMs": 1200
    },
    {
      "type": "click",
      "selector": "#9aafcfe4-1b58-4680-b2d7-149be4f97468"
    },
    {
      "type": "expect",
      "anyOf": [
        "text=/check your (e-?mail|inbox)/i",
        "text=/verify your (e-?mail|account)/i",
        "text=/verification (e-?mail|link|message)/i",
        "text=/confirmation (e-?mail|link) (has been )?sent/i",
        "text=/we('ve| have) sent you/i",
        "text=/activate your account/i",
        "text=/account (has been )?created/i",
        "text=/registration (successful|complete)/i"
      ],
      "timeoutMs": 25000
    }
  ],
  "verification": {
    "mode": "link",
    "timeoutMs": 180000
  },
  "notes": "OTOMATİK ÜRETİLDİ — doğrulanmadı Keşif: direct-path, 0 sıçrama, güven: high. Captcha: recaptcha_v2. TODO eşlenmeyen zorunlu alanlar: #dob (zorunlu, text), #field_604eb8ae14690 (zorunlu, select-multiple), #field_604eb472d2b22 (zorunlu, select-one), #field_604eb7c03a0d2 (zorunlu, select-one), #field_604eafdff7433 (zorunlu, select-one), #field_607e2bff197aa (zorunlu, select-one), #field_607e2c2f197ab (zorunlu, text), #field_604eaff6f7434 (zorunlu, select-one), #field_604eb027f7435 (zorunlu, number), #field_651db699ef96b (zorunlu, select-one). Uyarılar: Captcha tespit edildi: recaptcha_v2 | GÖRÜNMEZ ZORUNLU ALAN (label[for=...] tıklaması gerekebilir): #field_604eb9c540cee"
}
